  "caption": "Author card with its age; \"1 reply\" quiet; new badge; the inline comment field with its one button.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\" style=\"height:auto\"><div class=\"kanso-review__reply\"><div class=\"kanso-card__header\"><span class=\"kanso-avatar--round\">J</span><b>jj</b><span class=\"kanso-layout__grow\"></span><span class=\"kanso-text--dim\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">40m</span></div><div class=\"kanso-prose\">Good catch. The key becomes customer and plan; an upgrade starts a fresh bucket.</div></div><div class=\"kanso-panel__last-action\">1 reply, yours, 40m</div><span class=\"kanso-panel__new\">new</span><div class=\"kanso-review__comment\"><div class=\"kanso-field kanso-control--focus\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"kanso-prototype__text\">Round up here, or a client retries a second early.<span class=\"kanso-code__caret\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row\"><use href=\"#lu-send\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"kanso-actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button\" tabindex=\"0\">Comment</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
 },
